 "name_en": "Bill of Material Management Professional (6OT)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Bill of Material Management Professional (6OT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8c33f5f481854b7f86d868605f2ef553\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c33f5f481854b7f86d868605f2ef553__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides mass maintenance capabilities for BOM Engineers. They can first select the relevant BOMs with comprehensive search functions and then add, change, or delete BOM items, as well as change or delete BOM headers across the whole selection in one step. BOM Engineers can also simulate BOM changes prior to executing and releasing them. The execution protocol helps to re-execute changes that could not be processed.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c33f5f481854b7f86d868605f2ef553__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform BOM mass maintenance</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c33f5f481854b7f86d868605f2ef553__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform BOM mass maintenance to add, change and delete BOM items</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform BOM mass maintenance to change and delete BOM headers</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>物料清单管理专业人员 (6OT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8c33f5f481854b7f86d868605f2ef553\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c33f5f481854b7f86d868605f2ef553__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目为物料清单工程师提供批量维护功能。他们可以首先选择具有综合搜索功能的相关物料清单，然后一步添加、更改或删除物料清单项目，以及在整个选择中更改或删除物料清单抬头。物料清单工程师还可以在执行和发布之前模拟物料清单更改。执行协议有助于重新执行无法处理的更改。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c33f5f481854b7f86d868605f2ef553__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行物料清单批量维护</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c33f5f481854b7f86d868605f2ef553__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行物料清单批量维护以添加、更改和删除物料清单项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行物料清单批量维护，以更改和删除物料清单抬头</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
